# Qwen3.8-Flash-Next, Unsloth UD-IQ4_XS -- the same model as .env.qwen, quantized by Unsloth (3 shards).
# 128K context, 2 slots (setup recommends one at a time for this file: every slot takes VRAM from the
# expert cache; kept at 2 as the other presets). 93.7 GB download and 55 GiB of experts: they do not fit
# this box's 63 GB of RAM, so setup keeps ~36-37 GiB of them in RAM and reads the rest from the NVMe while
# it answers (setup's arithmetic, --resident-budget-gib; the config records the number). Slower than IQ2_XS;
# quality: 88.9% the same top token as Q8_0 against IQ3_XXS's 84.5% (5,000 positions, AMD EPYC 7452 +
# R9700, docs/QUANTS.md). No tokens/s measured for this file on a 24 GB card.
# 24 GB card + KV streaming (setup's choice at this RAM): the dense weights, the 32K window the attention
# reads and an expert cache stay in VRAM. CPU image encoder: no VRAM taken from the experts; pictures
# take a few seconds (measured on other machines).
# Switching: add "switch_on_request": true to /data/config/strata-unsloth-ud-iq4_xs.json once (or the web
# page's Model settings card), then restart, so /v1/models lists every installed model too.
# The data volume needs ~94 GB free beside the models already there.
# API_KEY is set in Coolify, not here.
FAMILY=unsloth
MODEL=UD-IQ4_XS
CONTEXT=131072
PARALLEL=2
CONVERSATION_CACHE_MIB=6144
CONVERSATION_CACHE_SLOTS=8
VISION=cpu
LOW_RAM=auto
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8080
REINSTALL=0
